        "detailed_description": "<h1>求关注</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>将游戏加入愿望单，您的关注对我真的真的非常重要~！</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660520/extras/3fa8365d3d1304cf49e8d19e41583dde.avif?t=1752303304\" width=600 height=218 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660520/extras/a43a58ad619227d612077d0abedcb864.avif?t=1752303304\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >选择宗门</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >玄天宗、血煞宗，以及未来的焚香谷、瑶池圣地、万佛门、弯刀门，不同的宗门会为场上的友方单位提供不同的特性加成</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660520/extras/984fe963d3fa6d407218f1f243a33c86.avif?t=1752303304\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660520/extras_big/984fe963d3fa6d407218f1f243a33c86.avif?t=1752303304 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >收集并升级单位</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50位不同特色和五行属性的角色，相同的五行属性单位可以激活五行特性，通过五行特性、宗门特性和单位自身技能，构筑出属于你的强力阵容</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660520/extras/42845c6bb5b1cdef5577ae824374d9a3.avif?t=1752303304\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660520/extras_big/42845c6bb5b1cdef5577ae824374d9a3.avif?t=1752303304 width=800 height=422 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >获取战利品装备宝物</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >天地玄黄四个等级，30种不同类别的装备，高阶装备还会附带能力，让你的单位一骑绝尘</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >与其他玩家一较高下</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >和你对抗的是真实玩家的阵容。看看其他玩家的阵容搭配，调整自己阵容的站位布置，想办法获胜。</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660520/extras/a43a58ad619227d612077d0abedcb864.avif?t=1752303304\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >选择宗门</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >玄天宗、血煞宗，以及未来的焚香谷、瑶池圣地、万佛门、弯刀门，不同的宗门会为场上的友方单位提供不同的特性加成</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660520/extras/984fe963d3fa6d407218f1f243a33c86.avif?t=1752303304\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660520/extras_big/984fe963d3fa6d407218f1f243a33c86.avif?t=1752303304 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >收集并升级单位</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50位不同特色和五行属性的角色，相同的五行属性单位可以激活五行特性，通过五行特性、宗门特性和单位自身技能，构筑出属于你的强力阵容</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660520/extras/42845c6bb5b1cdef5577ae824374d9a3.avif?t=1752303304\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660520/extras_big/42845c6bb5b1cdef5577ae824374d9a3.avif?t=1752303304 width=800 height=422 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >获取战利品装备宝物</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >天地玄黄四个等级，30种不同类别的装备，高阶装备还会附带能力，让你的单位一骑绝尘</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >与其他玩家一较高下</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >和你对抗的是真实玩家的阵容。看看其他玩家的阵容搭配，调整自己阵容的站位布置，想办法获胜。</p>",
        "short_description": "《五行乱斗》是一款用宗门加金木水火土五行作为棋子特性的传统自走棋游戏。选择宗门、抽取并强化角色、获得装备，组建属于你的仙门阵容体系，和其他玩家的阵容一决高下。",
